Credits (ideas, no code taken)
------------------------------

The edge-coefficient and DC predictions of the model (pas/pjamodel.pas) are
built on ideas published with Lepton (Dropbox) and on Lakhani's prediction
of the first AC coefficients.

The second prediction in the JPEG-LS symbol model (pas/pjamodel.pas) is
CALIC's gradient-adjusted prediction with its error feedback (Wu and Memon).
